    "updated_at": "2024-03-01T16:07:58Z",
    "body": "#397 is certainly an open question that's relevant here. I also don't think implementations ever enforced the limit for pure ASCII inputs. I'm not a 100% positive on also having tested long non-ASCII inputs, but I would also not be comfortable with having different length requirements for ASCII and non-ASCII.",
