    "created_at": "2024-03-04T12:18:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-04T12:18:14Z",
    "body": "I think agreeing on a maximum label length and a maximum number of labels would be reasonable. Presumably to be enforced after ToASCII is performed, but potentially possible to be inlined? Do we also want to agree on limits for other fields of a URL? All implementations probably have them.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
